# Task scope tags (mandatory)

Default is `[content]` when no tag is given. The tag affects **layer coverage only** — every other rule file stays mandatory regardless of tag.

| Tag | Touch |
|-----|-------|
| `[content]` | Pages under `docs/**` only: new page, rewrite, corrected copy. Default. |
| `[site]` | `sidebars.ts`, `docusaurus.config.ts`, `src/**` theme and components, `static/**` |
| `[cross-repo]` | A page documents behavior that changed in `monolith` or `monolith-vue-workers` — the code and the page land in the same task |

## `[cross-repo]` layer table

| Layer | What to touch |
|-------|----------------|
| Code | The sibling repo change (backend domain, SPA screen) — not this repo |
| Page | The page named by the trigger map in `docs-sync.mdc` |
| Manifest | The `docs-coverage.json` entry, added or updated |
| Navigation | `sidebars.ts` group or `docusaurus.config.ts` navbar/footer entry when the page is new |

A page change without its code counterpart, or a code change without its page, is **incomplete** unless the tag says otherwise.
